OL,3,GNEWSAHospital takes action over surgery
OL,4,Adeath rate
OL,5,
OL,6,FRotherham Hospital has introduced
OL,7,Fchanges after the death rate among
OL,8,Fpatients undergoing major abdominal
OL,9,Fsurgery was found to be higher than the
OL,10,Fnational average.
OL,12,FMortality following emergency
OL,13,Flaparotomies was 168% higher than the
OL,14,Fnational average in 2024/25, according
OL,15,Fto hospital board papers.
OL,17,FRotherham NHS Foundation Trust said 104
OL,18,Fpatients were included in the national
OL,19,Faudit covering April 2024 to March
OL,20,F2025. Of those patients, 14 died,
OL,21,Fequivalent to about one in seven.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
