OL,3,GNEWSAHospital takes action over surgery
OL,4,Adeath rate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said it had made efforts to
OL,7,Fdiagnose patients earlier and upgraded
OL,8,Fthe way patient information is passed
OL,9,Fbetween teams.
